sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant UI as PrivateCorridor
    participant INT as DepositIntentV0
    participant MS as CorridorMintedSet
    participant CH as cw-headstash
    participant OR as oracle

    Note over U,OR: Fail-closed reject path I1–I6 (cashapp_zec_corridor)
    Note over INT: Preauth seals domain_bind terp-cashapp-intent-v0 + dest_owner_binding

    U->>UI: settle swap or open dest
    UI->>INT: intent_allows_swap + mint gate

    alt I3 IntentExpired
        INT-->>UI: REJECT now ≥ expiry
    else I1 DestBindingMismatch
        INT-->>UI: REJECT actual_owner_binding ≠ dest_owner_binding
    else I2 MinOut or SlipExceeded
        INT-->>UI: REJECT out_value < min_out_value or mid slip floor
    else I6 OracleMissing or OracleStale
        OR-->>UI: REJECT mid missing or age > max_oracle_age_secs
        Note over OR,UI: bound_only — no silent mint
    else I4 AlreadyMinted
        UI->>MS: authorize_mint(burn_id)
        MS-->>UI: REJECT second mint same ν / intent
    else I5 ACCEPT bound OK
        UI->>MS: authorize_mint once
        UI->>CH: BridgeMintNote
        CH-->>UI: SeamNoteOutV0 owner_binding
        OR--xCH: oracle_mint_forbidden never mints
    end
